# Local development variables for `wrangler dev`.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored) and fill in your values.
#
# These are the ONLY settings needed to verify Clerk session JWTs.
# Verification uses the PUBLIC JWKS — there is NO Clerk secret key here on purpose.

# Clerk issuer = your Clerk Frontend API origin.
# Example: https://your-app.clerk.accounts.dev   (or your production Clerk domain)
CLERK_ISSUER="https://your-subdomain.clerk.accounts.dev"

# Clerk JWKS endpoint (public RS256 verification keys).
CLERK_JWKS_URL="https://your-subdomain.clerk.accounts.dev/.well-known/jwks.json"

# Optional: comma-separated allowlist of acceptable `azp` (authorized party) claims.
# Leave empty to skip the azp check (typical for a native mobile client).
CLERK_AUTHORIZED_PARTIES=""

# NEVER put real secrets, private keys, or production credentials in a committed file.
